r-30-forgotten-varieties-across-the-pacific-northwest/articleshow/134675678.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2012-a-retired-fbi-agent-began-searching-for-lost-apples-more-than-a-decade-later-his-mission-has-helped-rediscover-30-forgotten-varieties-across-the-pacific-northwest/articleshow/134675678.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-04T18:47:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134675810,imgsize-211182.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US man convicted of killing motorist to be resentenced after court rejects AI video of victim forgiving him]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134675493.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-man-convicted-of-killing-motorist-to-be-resentenced-after-court-rejects-ai-video-of-victim-forgiving-him/articleshow/134675493.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-man-convicted-of-killing-motorist-to-be-resentenced-after-court-rejects-ai-video-of-victim-forgiving-him/articleshow/134675493.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-04T18:42:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134675796,imgsize-84990.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Texas city to pay $175,000 after SpaceX site it owns overpumps 128m gallons of groundwater]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134675511.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The McGregor City Council has reached a settlement regarding penalties related to groundwater overpumping caused by SpaceX. The city will allocate $175,000 for this resolution and commit to a 25-year groundwater monitoring program. However, residents are concerned about who will bear these costs, urging that SpaceX should take financial responsibility.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-texas-city-will-pay-at-least-175000-after-the-spacex-site-it-owns-pumped-128-million-gallons-of-groundwater-above-permitted-limits-over-three-years-the-settlement-includes-monitoring-payments-for-25-years/articleshow/134675511.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-texas-city-will-pay-at-least-175000-after-the-spacex-site-it-owns-pumped-128-million-gallons-of-groundwater-above-permitted-limits-over-three-years-the-settlement-includes-monitoring-payments-for-25-years/articleshow/134675511.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-04T18:39:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134675744,imgsize-1241040.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Lionel Messi's foundation helped fund Barcelona's €37M cancer centre]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134674547.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/lionel-messis-foundation-helped-fund-a-37-million-childhood-cancer-centre-in-barcelona-when-it-opened-in-2022-the-hospital-gained-capacity-to-see-up-to-400-new-cancer-cases-a-year/articleshow/134674547.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/lionel-messis-foundation-helped-fund-a-37-million-childhood-cancer-centre-in-barcelona-when-it-opened-in-2022-the-hospital-gained-capacity-to-see-up-to-400-new-cancer-cases-a-year/articleshow/134674547.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-04T17:48:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns